        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.63m x 5.64m\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 8.95m x 5.64m\n\n\nFamily Room - 4.77m x 2.33m\n\n\nRecreation Room - 5.12m x 4.93m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.77m x 3.21m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.24m x 3.96m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 2.21m x 5.82m\n\n\nSitting Room - 4.78m x 5.64m\n\n\nDining Room - 4.08m x 5.64m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.97m x 2.08m\n\n\nW/C - \n\n\nSECOND FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 2.23m x 2.14m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.78m x 2.99m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.26m x 2.75m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.58m x 2.79m\n\n\nBathroom - 4.78m x 2.54m\n\n\nCOACH HOUSE - \n\n\nDining Area - 5.02m x 4.16m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.66m x 4.16m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.68m x 2.60m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.49m x 4.93m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.80m x 4.16m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.77m x 4.15m\n\n\nEn-Suite - \n\n\n"
